sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User/API
  participant G as API Gateway
  participant O as Analysis Orchestrator
  participant R as Resolver
  participant S as Static Analysis
  participant K as Graph Service
  participant E as Evidence Retrieval
  participant M as ML Service
  participant X as Simulation
  participant P as Postgres

  U->>G: Create analysis
  G->>O: analysis.requested
  O->>R: normalize and resolve pack
  R-->>O: resolved pack model + hard conflicts
  O->>S: analyze artifacts in parallel
  S-->>O: static overlap signals
  O->>K: fetch graph neighborhood
  K-->>O: relationship context
  O->>E: retrieve evidence bundle
  E-->>O: normalized evidence
  O->>M: score risks and rank candidates
  M-->>O: predictions + confidence inputs
  alt simulation enabled
    O->>X: run smoke test
    X-->>O: simulation outcomes
  end
  O->>P: persist findings and report
  O-->>G: completed analysis summary
  G-->>U: report ready
